# A Squire's Test II (sandoria 19): Balasiel and Chanpau in Southern San d'Oria, Morjean in Northern San d'Oria, qm2 and
# qm3 in Ordelle's Caves. A Squire's Test completed by GM; a trade while available (no trade
# handler: nothing); level 10: the offer 625 (any option begins it); Balasiel's 630; Morjean before Chanpau (Option 0: nil); Chanpau's 629 (Option 1) and, on the next talk, his script's 566 (an
# Event-priority action alternates with the NPC script: interaction_lookup.lua); Morjean's 602; qm3 before qm2 (Timer
# 0: DEW_SLIPS_THROUGH_FINGERS), qm2 (Timer = system time + 30, PLACE_HANDS_IN_POOL), qm3 within the 30 s (the
# Stalactite Dew), qm3 again (ALREADY_OBTAINED_DEW), qm2 with the dew (no Timer, the message); Balasiel's 626 (completed:
# fame +20, the Squire Certificate, Spelunker; the dew deleted); A Knight's Test's 670 afterwards (level 10, below 30).
# Balasiel's default 667; Chanpau's script: 566 (The Brugaire Consortium not completed); Morjean's script answers The
# Holy Crest only (TheHolyCrest_Event 2-4), his default 601; qm2 / qm3 default NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Balasiel/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Balasiel/onTrade SouthernSanDoria/Chanpau/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/625 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/626 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/629 NorthernSanDoria/Morjean/onTrigger OrdellesCaves/qm2/onTrigger OrdellesCaves/qm3/onTrigger
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-136.8,-10.8,65.8 lvl=10
quest Sandoria.ASquiresTest completed
item BoneChip
login
trade Balasiel BoneChip x1                # available: no trade handler, nothing
trigger Balasiel                          # A Squire's Test completed, level 10: 625
finish option=1                           # any option: begun
trigger Balasiel                          # accepted, no dew: 630
finish
warp 97,0,114 NorthernSanDoria
trigger Morjean                           # Option 0: nil; his script answers nothing: his default 601
finish-if-event
warp -152.7,-2,56.3 SouthernSanDoria
trigger Chanpau                           # accepted: 629
finish                                    # Option 1
trigger Chanpau                           # the NPC script's turn: his 566
finish
warp 97,0,114 NorthernSanDoria
trigger Morjean                           # Option 1: 602
finish
warp -90.2,1.2,276.2 OrdellesCaves
trigger qm3                               # no dew, Timer 0: DEW_SLIPS_THROUGH_FINGERS
trigger qm2                               # no dew: Timer = now + 30, PLACE_HANDS_IN_POOL
trigger qm3                               # within the 30 s: the key item Stalactite Dew
trigger qm3                               # the dew held: ALREADY_OBTAINED_DEW
trigger qm2                               # the dew held: no Timer, PLACE_HANDS_IN_POOL
warp -136.8,-10.8,65.8 SouthernSanDoria
trigger Balasiel                          # the dew: 626
finish                                    # completed: fame +20, the Squire Certificate, Spelunker; the dew deleted
trigger Balasiel                          # completed: A Knight's Test, level 10: its 670
finish
